  "title": "Helen J Probable NDE 5314",
  "date": "15 September 1995",
  "content": "I had a life threatening operation in June of 1995 for a burst ulcer. The surgery went wrong, so three months later I had a second emergency operation. I was told I would not survive without this operation. Between the first and second operations, I was so sick and very weak. By the second operation, I didn't know where I was. They came to take me to the operating room. I felt scared. My chances of survival were 50-50. During the operation, I suddenly found myself in this awful blackness. I felt sick with fear. It felt evil. I felt as though I was dragged backwards down a flight of stairs and my head bounced down each step. I feel better for telling about this awful experience. Thank you for the opportunity to do this. It has been 16 years since this experience and I feel great. I have, over the past ten years become best friends with the Holy Spirit, which is such a nice feeling. I don't think this was due the experience though.",
